    {
      "text": "Nephi1 finds Laban drunken with wine, 1 Ne. 4:7. those who oppress the Lord’s people shall be drunken with own blood, 1 Ne. 21:26 (22:13; Isa. 49:26). hear this, thou drunken, and not with wine, 2 Ne. 8:21. in last days Gentiles and Jews shall be drunken with iniquity, 2 Ne. 27:1. Lamanites will be drunken, so that Limhi’s people can escape, Mosiah 22:7. Nephites cause Lamanites to become drunken, Alma 55:14. Nephites would not destroy Lamanites in their drunkenness, Alma 55:19. Lamanites try to destroy Nephites with poison or drunkenness, Alma 55:30. Jaredites drunken with anger, as man who is drunken with wine, Ether 15:22.",
